/*
  ClimateControlPanelWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0026 · ClimateControlPanelWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `ClimateControlPanelWidget` resolves (table "ClimateControlPanelWidget") lives
  here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the
  app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in
  a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/ClimateControlPanelWidget.tsx) — the shell title, the
  empty message, the HVAC on/off labels, the four metric titles, the "Off" wheel
  fallback, the seat-position labels, the no-seat-heaters fallback, and the Defrost
  / Bat-Heater chip labels. The remaining keys back the native-only chrome (the kW
  unit suffix, registry description, freshness chip, refresh/retry/loading/error
  copy, and accessibility).
*/

